<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Your profile, with clear boundaries.</h1></section><section class="content-section narrow"><h2>What this product keeps</h2><p>Profile biographies, public accomplishments, public social URLs, verified result projections, source-link state, and administrative history.</p><h2>What it does not keep</h2><p>Social-media passwords or tokens, private feeds, League or Tournament contacts, credentials, sessions, or operational data.</p><h2>Third-party social content</h2><p>Public Facebook or X content loads only after a visitor chooses. At that point the provider may receive browser, IP, cookie, and page information under its own terms.</p></section>
